          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do I need a receipt for an Icon or Tekton warranty claim?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Tekton says no receipt is needed; you submit a photo of the broken tool with your name and the date, and it ships a replacement for free. Harbor Freight's written warranty asks for the receipt and covers the original purchaser, though many owners report swapping broken Icon hand tools at the counter without one. Keep receipts for Icon to be safe."
